<title>FRANCE: AT&amp;T has no comment on GdesEaux deal.</title>
<headline>AT&amp;T has no comment on GdesEaux deal.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>An international spokesman for U.S. telecoms group AT&amp;T had no comment on whether the company would or would not team up with Generale des Eaux's telecommunications unit.</p>
<p>&quot;Only Mr Messier can say,&quot; the spokesman, reached by telephone, said.</p>
<p>Generale des Eaux Chairman Jean-Marie Messier will on Thursday morning unveil the identities of international partners for the company's Cegetel unit which aims to become France's number two telecoms operator.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
